Subject: [PATCH] stability and speed units of 2026-11-06/07 on 2 x DGX Spark (both ranks)

On top of 0060 (the bundle-10 tree), bundle 11: a stream whose first round copies from its prompt asks the drafter for no
first drafts when the copy holds (the copy probe at admission, as later rounds since 0060); the Pillow child's exchange
has a 110 s deadline (a hung child held every later non-PNG picture; it is killed, restarted and that picture refused),
and a failed retry always restarts it; /metrics counts every reply's status without API keys too (key="unauthenticated").
CPU-tested with red copies, source-reviewed, and A/B-checked on the pair: 92/92 replies exact against bundle 10
(research/LOCAL-STACK-20261106.md, "Bundle 11"). Generated with `git diff --binary` in a checkout of the 0060 tree;
`git apply` of it gives the served source file for file (1286 files, sha256-compared).

